, and fires an effort just off target.\",\"team_0\":{\"relevance\":4,\"players\":[{\"jersey_number\":null,\"position\":\"left winger\",\"tags\":[\"Control\",\"Dribble\",\"Goal\"],\"decision_score\":4,\"execution_score\":4,\"note\":\"Direct, positive 1v1 wing play cutting inside to threaten goal in the style of Rafael Leao.\"}]},\"team_1\":{\"relevance\":0,\"players\":[]}},{\"start\":\"04:13\",\"end\":\"04:26\",\"summary\":\"A loose pass in midfield triggers an opponent counter-attack down our right flank, where our centre-back dives in and is beaten before the opponent scores.\",\"team_0\":{\"relevance\":4,\"players\":[{\"jersey_number\":null,\"position\":\"central midfielder\",\"tags\":[\"Pass\"],\"decision_score\":2,\"execution_score\":1,\"note\":\"Protect possession in central areas when teammates are pushed high; take a safer touch or play backwards rather than forcing a risky pass.\"},{\"jersey_number\":null,\"position\":\"right centre-back\",\"tags\":[\"Tackle\"],\"decision_score\":2,\"execution_score\":1,\"note\":\"When isolated in transition, jockey and delay the ball carrier toward the touchline instead of diving into a tackle you cannot guarantee winning.\"},{\"jersey_number\":null,\"position\":\"goalkeeper\",\"tags\":[\"Save\"],\"decision_score\":3,\"execution_score\":2,\"note\":\"Hold your ground slightly longer on the angled 1v1 so you are set to react rather than committing early.\"}]},\"team_1\":{\"relevance\":0,\"players\":[]}},{\"start\":\"04:39\",\"end\":\"04:45\",\"summary\":\"Our central midfielder reads a 50/50 ball near the centre circle and wins a committed sliding tackle to launch a quick attack.\",\"team_0\":{\"relevance\":4,\"players\":[{\"jersey_number\":null,\"position\":\"central midfielder\",\"tags\":[\"Tackle\",\"Pass\"],\"decision_score\":5,\"execution_score\":5,\"note\":\"Tenacious midfield ball-winning challenge to spark the counter like Declan Rice.\"}]},\"team_1\":{\"relevance\":0,\"players\":[]}},{\"start\":\"04:43\",\"end\":\"04:53\",\"summary\":\"Our attacking midfielder spreads play to the right wing, where our right winger drives forward and curls an extraordinary long-range lob over the goalkeeper into the top corner.\",\"team_0\":{\"relevance\":5,\"players\":[{\"jersey_number\":null,\"position\":\"attacking midfielder\",\"tags\":[\"Control\",\"Pass\",\"Assist\",\"Chance Creation\"],\"decision_score\":5,\"execution_score\":5,\"note\":\"Quick awareness and crisp weight of pass into space to set up the attack like Kevin De Bruyne.\"},{\"jersey_number\":null,\"position\":\"right winger\",\"tags\":[\"Control\",\"Dribble\",\"Goal\"],\"decision_score\":5,\"execution_score\":5,\"note\":\"Audacious vision and flawless long-range dipping finish over the keeper reminiscent of Mohamed Salah.\"}]},\"team_1\":{\"relevance\":0,\"players\":[]}}]}",
